# DigitalGuardian area 53: the body (editor id 00350060) and head (0035000f) are woken and the body is scanned
# (console `scan`; the first call raises the scan visor): the scan display calls fn_14_9CA4 and
# fn_14_9ABC.
@f30 layer 3
@f60 layer 11
@f140 send e00350060 Activate; send e0035000f Activate
@f300 scan e00350060
@f360 scan e00350060
@f420 scan
@f520 scan
@f620 scan
@f760 scan
@f900 scan
